{"parse":{"title":"kenspeck","pageid":4969658,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"English\">English</h2></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Etymology\">Etymology</h3></div>\n<p>Apparently from <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Old_Norse\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Old Norse\">Old Norse</a></span> <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"non\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=kennispakr&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"kennispakr (page does not exist)\">kennispakr</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">quick at recognizing persons or things</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>, from <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"non\"><a href=\"/wiki/kenna#Old_Norse\" title=\"kenna\">kenna</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">know, recognize</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span> + <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"non\"><a href=\"/wiki/spakr#Old_Norse\" title=\"spakr\">spakr</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">wise</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>. Compare Swedish <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"sv\"><a href=\"/wiki/k%C3%A4nnspak#Swedish\" title=\"kännspak\">kännspak</a></i>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Pronunciation\">Pronunciation</h3></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:International_Phonetic_Alphabet\" title=\"Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet\">IPA</a><sup>(<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:English_pronunciation\" title=\"Appendix:English pronunciation\">key</a>)</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">/ˈkɛn.spɛk/</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\"><span class=\"usage-label-accent\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/pin%E2%80%93pen_merger\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:pin–pen merger\"><i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\">pin</i>–<i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\">pen</i> merger</a></span></span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:International_Phonetic_Alphabet\" title=\"Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet\">IPA</a><sup>(<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:English_pronunciation\" title=\"Appendix:English pronunciation\">key</a>)</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">/ˈkɪn.spɛk/</span></li>\n<li>Rhymes: <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Rhymes:English/%C9%9Bnsp%C9%9Bk&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Rhymes:English/ɛnspɛk (page does not exist)\"><span class=\"IPA nowrap\">-ɛnspɛk</span></a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Adjective\">Adjective</h3></div>\n<p><span class=\"headword-line\"><strong class=\"Latn headword\" lang=\"en\">kenspeck</strong></span>\n</p>\n<ol><li><span class=\"usage-label-sense\"><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content label-content\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/British_English\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:British English\">UK</a><span class=\"ib-comma label-comma\">,</span>&#32;<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#dialectal\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">dialect</a><span class=\"ib-comma label-comma\">,</span>&#32;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/English_language_in_Northern_England\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:English language in Northern England\">Northern England</a><span class=\"ib-comma label-comma\">,</span>&#32;<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#obsolete\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">obsolete</a></span><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">)</span></span> Easily known or seen; <a href=\"/wiki/obvious\" title=\"obvious\">obvious</a>; <a href=\"/wiki/apparent\" title=\"apparent\">apparent</a>.</li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Derived_terms\">Derived terms</h4></div>\n<div class=\"list-switcher-wrapper\"><div class=\"term-list columns-bg\"><ul><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/kenspecked#English\" title=\"kenspecked\">kenspecked</a></span></li></ul></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐web.codfw.main‐8875b6b85‐qgjjj\nCached time: 20260925005746\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.207 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.325 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 171/1000000\nRevision size: 493/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 7827/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 989/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 7/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 9/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.176/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 10698134/104857600 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 0/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  314.981      1 -total\n 60.65%  191.022      1 Template:der\n 16.66%   52.473      3 Template:no_deprecated_lang_param_usage\n 15.23%   47.961      2 Template:IPA\n  8.10%   25.512      1 Template:en-adj\n  7.37%   23.218      1 Template:lb\n  3.53%   11.118      1 Template:col\n  2.84%    8.953      4 Template:m\n  2.12%    6.664      1 Template:rhymes\n  0.75%    2.377      1 Template:m+\n-->\n\n<!-- Render ID 1ef4a3fe-b87c-11f1-96f3-cdf6523c9de0 -->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key enwiktionary:pcache:4969658:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20260925005746 and revision id 92416055. Rendering was triggered because: page_view\n -->\n</div>"}}